3. Other public kernels used as opponents
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Controlled comparisons in this project were run against additional public Kaggle
kernels by other authors, used as fixed opponents and not modified. Each one is
recorded — author, source URL, licence, whether the kernel was public, the date it
was pulled, a SHA-256 for every file, and the experiments that consumed it — in
the public-kernel provenance register:

    workflow/PUBLIC-KERNELS-PROVENANCE.md

Licences there were read from the kernel pages by a human and recorded with the
date of verification. Where a licence could not be verified, the kernel was not
consumed by a measurement.

Those kernels are NOT redistributed in this repository. The register records where
to obtain each one from its original author, and a SHA-256 for every file so that
a reader can confirm they have the same bytes we measured.

